 not go "},{"t":"unpunished","s":["H5352"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And he who utters "},{"t":"lies","s":["H3577"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will not "},{"t":"escape","s":["H4422"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Many will entreat the favor of the generous man, And every man is a friend to one who gives gifts.","tok":[{"t":"Many","s":["H7227"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will entreat the favor of the generous man, And every man is a "},{"t":"friend","s":["H7453"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to one who gives "},{"t":"gifts","s":["H4976"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"All the brothers of the poor man hate him; How much more do his friends go far from him! He pursues them with words, but they are not there.","tok":[{"t":"All the "},{"t":"brothers","s":["H0251"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"poor","s":["H7326"],"a":[2]},{"t":" man "},{"t":"hate","s":["H8130"],"a":[3]},{"t":" him; How much more do his "},{"t":"friends","s":["H4828"],"a":[6]},{"t":" go "},{"t":"far","s":["H7368"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from him! He "},{"t":"pursues","s":["H7291"],"a":[9]},{"t":" them with "},{"t":"words","s":["H0561"],"a":[10]},{"t":", but they are not there."}]},{"n":8,"text":"He who acquires sense loves his own soul; He who keeps understanding will find good.","tok":[{"t":"He who acquires sense "},{"t":"loves","s":["H0157"],"a":[2]},{"t":" his own "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; He who "},{"t":"keeps","s":["H8104"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"understanding","s":["H8394"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"find","s":["H4672"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"A false witness will not go unpunished, And he who utters lies will perish.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"false","s":["H8267"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"witness","s":["H5707"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will not go "},{"t":"unpunished","s":["H5352"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And he who utters "},{"t":"lies","s":["H3577"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"perish","s":["H0006"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Delicate living is not fitting for a fool; Much less for a servant to rule over princes.","tok":[{"t":"Delicate living is not fitting for a "},{"t":"fool","s":["H3684"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; Much less for a "},{"t":"servant","s":["H5650"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"rule","s":["H4910"],"a":[7]},{"t":" over "},{"t":"princes","s":["H8269"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"The discretion of a man makes him slow to anger, And it is his glory to overlook a transgression.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"discretion","s":["H7922"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[1]},{"t":" makes him slow to "},{"t":"anger","s":["H0639"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And it is his "},{"t":"glory","s":["H8597"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"overlook","s":["H5674"],"a":[5]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"transgression","s":["H6588"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"The king’s wrath is like the roaring of a lion, But his favor is like dew upon the grass.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"king’s","s":["H4428"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H2197"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is like the "},{"t":"roaring","s":["H5099"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"lion","s":["H3715"],"a":[1]},{"t":", But his favor is like "},{"t":"dew","s":["H2919"],"a":[4]},{"t":" upon the "},{"t":"grass","s":["H6212"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"A foolish son is the ruin of his father, And the contentions of a wife are a continual dripping.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"foolish","s":["H3684"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is the ruin of his "},{"t":"father","s":["H0001"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"contentions","s":["H4079"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"wife","s":["H0802"],"a":[7]},{"t":" are a "},{"t":"continual","s":["H2956"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dripping","s":["H1812"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"House and wealth are an inheritance from fathers, But a prudent wife is from Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"House","s":["H1004"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and wealth are an "},{"t":"inheritance","s":["H5159"],"a":[2]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"fathers",